    {
      "id": "2120757785738777030",
      "text": "\"This is everything he has ever dreamed of and wanted and dedicated his life to.\" #GoBolts’ top prospect Sam O’Reilly’s #NHL debut was a night to remember. Reporting from Buffalo in this @TB_Times story: https://t.co/evr530YICm",
