    {
      "id": "2120753566889750989",
      "text": "The #GoBolts still have a problem closing out games, but thanks to Nikita Kucherov’s natural hat trick in the third period, the #TBLightning pulled away with a 8-3 road win over division rival #Sabrehood. Reporting from Buffalo in this @TB_Times story: https://t.co/KD8b1bndaD",
      "url": "https://x.com/EddieInTheYard/status/2120753566889750989",
      "published": "2026-11-12T05:40:26+00:00",
