    {
      "id": "2120723307376902160",
      "text": "#GoBolts Cooper on O'Reilly playing top six and power play in his debut: \"We don't have too many right sticks out of there, and he's been good in there. O'Rei played in that spot for us the last two training camps and he did extremely well. So I have no problem with that. He can",
