      "published": "2026-11-12T03:40:12+00:00",
      "likes": 187,
      "author": "Benjamin Pierce",
      "handle": "BenjaminJReport",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2038752916618817536/A5zwyb8q_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Congrats to Sam O'Reilly, who just earned his first NHL point in his NHL debut with the secondary assist on the 4-0 goal. He's the 22nd player in franchise history to get a point in their first career game. #GoBolts https://t.co/8s2JFUQpU7",
      "quoted_author": "Benjamin Pierce",
      "quoted_handle": "BenjaminJReport"
    },
    {
      "id": "2120722211556249933",
      "text": "Injury update: Jon Cooper said in his postgame media availability that Erik Cernak is \"probably\" out tomorrow in Columbus and then will be re-evaluated. Cernak left in the second period and didn't return. #GoBolts",
